=== str-substr-rw-assign
from: CSS::Writer 0.3.3 lib/CSS/Writer.rakumod:34
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method substr-rw
--- code
my $name-uk = 'lightgray';
with $name-uk.index("gray") {
    $name-uk.substr-rw($_, 4) = 'grey';
}
say $name-uk;
--- expect
lightgrey

