=== str-index-with-offset
from: BDD::Behave 0.9.5 lib/BDD/Behave/Coverage.rakumod:495
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method index
--- code
my $file-part = 'sub foo (lib/Foo.rakumod:12)';
my $open = $file-part.rindex(' (');
my $close = $file-part.index(')', $open);
say $file-part.substr($open + 2, $close - $open - 2);
--- expect
lib/Foo.rakumod:12

=== str-index-with-modifier
from: CSS::Specification 0.5.3 lib/CSS/Specification/Base/Actions.rakumod:101
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method index
--- code
for 'border-color', 'margin' {
    my $name = $_;
    $name .= substr(0, $_) with $name.index('-');
