=== str-flip-or-reverse
from: Template::Jinja2 0.3.0 lib/Template/Jinja2/Filters.rakumod:264
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method flip
--- code
sub reverse-filter($value) {
    $value ~~ Str ?? $value.flip !! $value.reverse.list;
}
say reverse-filter('stressed');
say reverse-filter([1, 2, 3]);
--- expect
desserts
(3 2 1)
